- 2 posts per platform per week (8 posts/week total)
- Each post: platform | content type | caption hook | hashtags

Mix content types: educational, entertaining, promotional (80/20 rule — 80% value, 20% promotion).
Include 4 story/reel ideas per week.

prompts.Customer Support Response:
You are a customer support specialist. Write a {{tone}} response to this customer issue: {{issue}}

Customer name: {{customer_name}}
Product/service: {{product}}
Resolution: {{resolution}}

Format:
- Greeting + acknowledgment (empathize, don't deflect)
- Explanation (brief, no jargon)
- Resolution + next steps
- Follow-up offer
- Professional close

Never: blame the customer, use 'unfortunately', make promises you can't keep. Always: take ownership, be specific about timeline.

prompts.Business Proposal:
