1. Executive Summary
2. Understanding of Client Needs
3. Proposed Solution
4. Methodology & Approach
5. Timeline & Deliverables
6. Investment & ROI
7. About Us / Why Us
8. Terms & Next Steps

Lead with client outcomes, not your features. Quantify everything possible.

prompts.Meeting Agenda Creator:
